{"format":1,"manifest":{"name":"one-light-classic","publisher":"vyloxi","version":"1.0.0","displayName":"One Light Classic","description":"A clean light theme with gentle colors.","engines":{"ferrum":"^0.1.0"},"categories":["Themes"],"icon":"icon.png","repository":"https://github.com/voukengdongmofrankysteve/ferrum-market","license":"MIT","contributes":{"themes":[{"label":"One Light Classic","path":"themes/one-light-classic.json","uiTheme":"light"}]}},"files":{"icon.png":{"encoding":"base64","content":""},"themes/one-light-classic.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"name\": \"One Light Classic\",\n  \"type\": \"light\",\n  \"colors\": {\n    \"editor.background\": \"#fafafa\",\n    \"editor.foreground\": \"#383a42\",\n    \"sideBar.background\": \"#f0f0f1\",\n    \"activityBar.background\": \"#eaeaeb\",\n    \"titleBar.activeBackground\": \"#eaeaeb\",\n    \"tab.inactiveBackground\": \"#eaeaeb\",\n    \"list.hoverBackground\": \"#e5e5e6\",\n    \"list.activeSelectionBackground\": \"#e5e5e6\",\n    \"input.background\": \"#ffffff\",\n    \"editorWidget.background\": \"#f0f0f1\",\n    \"panel.border\": \"#dbdbdc\",\n    \"focusBorder\": \"#4078f2\",\n    \"button.background\": \"#4078f2\",\n    \"textLink.foreground\": \"#4078f2\",\n    \"editor.selectionBackground\": \"#e5e5e6\",\n    \"editor.lineHighlightBackground\": \"#e5e5e680\",\n    \"editorCursor.foreground\": \"#4078f2\",\n    \"editorIndentGuide.background\": \"#dbdbdc\",\n    \"errorForeground\": \"#e45649\",\n    \"gitDecoration.addedResourceForeground\": \"#50a14f\",\n    \"gitDecoration.modifiedResourceForeground\": \"#c18401\",\n    \"gitDecoration.deletedResourceForeground\": \"#e45649\"\n  },\n  \"tokenColors\": [\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"comment\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#a0a1a7\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"string\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#50a14f\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"constant.numeric\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#986801\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"keyword\",\n        \"storage\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#a626a4\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"entity.name.type\",\n        \"support.type\",\n        \"storage.type\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#c18401\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"entity.name.function\",\n        \"support.function\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#4078f2\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"constant.language\",\n        \"constant\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#986801\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"variable.other.property\",\n        \"support.type.property-name\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#e45649\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"entity.name.tag\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#e45649\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"entity.other.attribute-name\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#986801\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"entity.name.function.macro\",\n        \"meta.preprocessor\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#0184bc\"\n      }\n    }\n  ]\n}\n"},"README.md":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"# One Light Classic\n\nA clean light theme with gentle colors.\n\nInstall it, then pick **One Light Classic** in **Settings > Colour theme**. It is a light theme.\n\nInspired by the Atom One Light palette.\n\n| Role | Color |\n| --- | --- |\n| Background | `#fafafa` |\n| Text | `#383a42` |\n| Accent | `#4078f2` |\n| Keywords | `#a626a4` |\n| Strings | `#50a14f` |\n| Functions | `#4078f2` |\n| Types | `#c18401` |\n| Comments | `#a0a1a7` |\n\nThis extension is only a theme: it runs no code and asks for no permissions.\n"}}}